+| Operations | `belowZeroFrom(0, OPS)` | Canonical Python | Candidate Python |
+|---|---:|---:|---:|
+| `[]` | `false` | `False` | `False` |
+| `[1, -1]` | `false` | `False` | `False` |
+| `[1, -2]` | `true` | `True` | `True` |
